{"id":"1c94545e8fa521ff","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-formula.md","title":"公式的有限归纳构造","display":"df-formula — 公式的有限归纳构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-formula","aliases":["56-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — 公式的有限归纳构造","depends_on":["[[56-df-atomic-formula]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — 公式的有限归纳构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06f27abe4d7ff714\" href=\"?note=06f27abe4d7ff714\" title=\"56-df-atomic-formula\">56-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{AtFml}_L\">\\(L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{AtFml}_L\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06f27abe4d7ff714\" href=\"?note=06f27abe4d7ff714\" title=\"56-df-atomic-formula\">56-df-atomic-formula</a>；原子构造器的外层标签分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 为集合编码的表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>。逻辑构造器使用以下有序对编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\varphi\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle3,(\\varphi,\\psi)\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle4,(\\varphi,\\psi)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\varphi\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle3,(\\varphi,\\psi)\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle4,(\\varphi,\\psi)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle5,(x,\\varphi)\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle6,(x,\\varphi)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle5,(x,\\varphi)\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle6,(x,\\varphi)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\land\\psi),(\\varphi\\lor\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\exists x\\,\\varphi:x\\in\\mathcal V,\\varphi\\in F_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\land\\psi),(\\varphi\\lor\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\exists x\\,\\varphi:x\\in\\mathcal V,\\varphi\\in F_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Form}_L\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按有限阶段构造最小公式集合，避免旧文没有解释的 InductiveClosure 与自指的 CompoundFml。这里采用五个逻辑构造子；蕴含等其他联结词可作局部可展开缩写。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"06f27abe4d7ff714","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"06f27abe4d7ff714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{AtFml}_L$，见 [[56-df-atomic-formula]]；原子构造器的外层标签分别为 $0,1$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{AtFml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\varphi\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle3,(\\varphi,\\psi)\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle4,(\\varphi,\\psi)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle5,(x,\\varphi)\\rangle,\\qquad\n(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle6,(x,\\varphi)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_L.","display":true},{"tex":"F_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\land\\psi),(\\varphi\\lor\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\exists x\\,\\varphi:x\\in\\mathcal V,\\varphi\\in F_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_L\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n.","display":true}],"bytes":1640,"backlinks":[{"id":"9950d502a3a677fa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 及公式构造器见 [[56-df-formula]]；$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$，$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$，$x\\in\\mathcal V$。"},{"id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)$；项集 $\\mathrm{Term}_L$ 与公式集 $\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 分别见 [[56-df-term]]、[[56-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-319","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-formula.md]]"}],"outgoing":["06f27abe4d7ff714"]}